    "new": "typed Array[T] and Dictionary[K, V] survive var_to_bytes / bytes_to_var (probed); snapshots may use typed or untyped containers and the walk checks decoded element types"
  },
  {
    "file": "design/gdd/save-load-and-versioned-format.md (SL-2)",
    "old": "or the owner's own canonical byte form where it publishes one (the Graph's `canonical_bytes()`, LS-21), as raw bytes inside the container",
    "new": "a block that publishes canonical bytes embeds them as a PackedByteArray field of its snapshot Dictionary; one payload form, canonical bytes are hash input only (ADR-0005)"
  },
  {
